<title>FRANCE: Rhone, Merck establish j/v.</title>
<headline>Rhone, Merck establish j/v.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc SA said it and Merck &amp; Co Inc were closing their planned merger of animal health and poultry genetics business on July 31 to form Merial Ltd, a 50/50 joint venture.</p>
<p>The company, which would have sales of $1.9 billion a year, is expected to be operational on August 1.</p>
<p>The European Union cleared the joint venture on July 3.</p>
<p>The merger will make Merial the world's largest company in the field of the discovery, manufacture and marketing of veterinary pharmaceuticals and vaccines, they said.</p>
<p>Worldwide headquarters will be in London.</p>
</text>
